    "metadata": "[Year: 2013] [Marks: 10] [Group: UPSC CSE] [Exam: Mains] [Stage: Mains] [Paper: Mains - GS 2] [Subject: INTERNATIONAL RELATIONS] [Section Group: Global Geopolitics & Indian Diaspora] [Microtopic: Global Policies & Politics: Effect of Policies & Politics of Developed & Developing Countries on India's Interests] [Subtopic: Geo-politics affecting India's Interest] [Macrotag: Descriptive, Applied] [Microtag: What, How, Outline, India]",
