    "id": "Q257",
    "statement": "Q257. Terrorism has become a significant threat to global peace and security’. Evaluate the effectiveness of the United Nations Security Council’s Counter-Terrorism Commit- tee (CTC) and its associated bodies in addressing and mitigating this threat at the international level.",
