    "id": "Q267",
    "statement": "Q267. WTO is an important international institution where decisions taken affect countries in profound manner. What is the mandate of WTO and how binding are their deci- sions? Critically analyse India’s stand on the latest round of talks on Food security.",
    "year": "2014",
